// RUN: cd %corpus && ! %zomc compile --check 08-adt/inherent_method_mutating_field_read_neg_04.zom > %t 2>&1
// RUN: %FileCheck %s --input-file %t

// Reading a field through the implicit `this` receiver is admitted only for
// shared receivers in this slice. The same `this.value` read inside a
// `mutating` method without an admitted write is well-formed source the
// HIR/MIR/LIR rail cannot lower yet, so the owning method is drained as the
// capability rejection ZOM4099, never an internal compiler error.

// CHECK-LITERAL: Error [ZOM4099]: this function body uses a construct the compiler cannot generate code for yet
// CHECK-LITERAL:   --> conformance/08-adt/inherent_method_mutating_field_read_neg_04.zom:3:3
